        "created_at": "2018-02-05T16:04:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In the Dahan portion it states \"among a spirits lands\".&nbsp; I interpretted this to mean among lands where the spirit has presence but on most other cards it stated that specifically or states on each board.&nbsp; I was unable to locate any clarification on this in the FAQ when my wife was asking me about this.&nbsp; This was more of an issue because I was playing Thunderspeaker and my wife was playing Keeper of the Forbidden Wilds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks in advance!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sarpathian</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:54.988Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
