        "raw": "<p>In the Dahan portion it states &quot;among a spirits lands&quot;.&nbsp; I interpretted this to mean among lands where the spirit has presence but on most other cards it stated that specifically or states on each board.&nbsp; I was unable to locate any clarification on this in the FAQ when my wife was asking me about this.&nbsp; This was more of an issue because I was playing Thunderspeaker and my wife was playing Keeper of the Forbidden Wilds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks in advance!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sarpathian</p>",
